WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.960 --> 01:32.840
=Episode 7=

02:23.300 --> 02:23.950
(It's him.)

03:09.670 --> 03:10.300
(Commander.)

03:26.579 --> 03:27.500
(Wanhua Pavilion.)

03:28.430 --> 03:29.870
(I must follow him inside.)

03:30.579 --> 03:31.990
(The Commander is too upright)

03:32.579 --> 03:34.020
(to visit such a place.)

03:34.550 --> 03:36.100
(It's my chance to shake him off.)

03:38.790 --> 03:40.670
(Wanhua Pavilion)

03:53.740 --> 03:54.430
Mr. Zhang.

03:54.829 --> 03:55.710
We've been waiting.

03:57.990 --> 03:58.660
Come on.

03:59.060 --> 03:59.710
Hurry up.

04:00.150 --> 04:01.270
Upstairs, please.

04:01.270 --> 04:01.900
Alright.

04:05.300 --> 04:06.740
Mr. Wang.

04:06.740 --> 04:07.870
I've missed you so much.

04:08.110 --> 04:09.620
The girls are ready.

04:10.500 --> 04:11.620
Have a great time.

04:11.870 --> 04:12.670
Alright.

04:14.550 --> 04:15.870
Serve our young master well.

04:16.350 --> 04:16.990
Alright.

04:17.500 --> 04:18.670
Do come again.

04:18.820 --> 04:20.820
Let me keep you company.

04:20.990 --> 04:22.550
I haven't seen you in ages.

04:24.030 --> 04:26.430
Have fun. Drink plenty.

04:30.280 --> 04:31.110
Alright.

04:31.380 --> 04:33.220
Young master, long time no see.

04:33.500 --> 04:34.380
Yunyan.

04:35.430 --> 04:37.000
Entertain the young master.

04:37.110 --> 04:37.740
No problem.

04:38.300 --> 04:39.260
You look new here.

04:39.380 --> 04:40.490
Is this your first visit?

04:41.060 --> 04:41.640
Yeah.

04:41.740 --> 04:42.600
New experience.

04:42.740 --> 04:43.620
Please show me around.

04:43.990 --> 04:45.430
We have the best girls here.

04:45.790 --> 04:46.820
Check out the new ones.

04:47.030 --> 04:47.590
Miss.

04:47.820 --> 04:49.620
Shall we go upstairs?

04:50.180 --> 04:52.140
What's the rush, young master?

04:53.110 --> 04:54.140
The night is short.

04:54.550 --> 04:55.740
Let's not waste it.

04:55.940 --> 04:56.670
Alright.

04:58.030 --> 04:58.670
Young master.

04:59.140 --> 04:59.740
Isn't that

04:59.870 --> 05:01.030
the fortune teller we met

05:01.030 --> 05:02.030
returning from Que City?

05:02.500 --> 05:03.590
Why is he here?

05:03.910 --> 05:04.550
Here.

05:04.940 --> 05:05.620
See?

05:05.990 --> 05:07.110
Isn't she nice?

05:16.300 --> 05:17.060
Bro,

05:18.230 --> 05:19.430
fate led us to meet.

05:19.940 --> 05:21.620
I know some fortune-telling.

05:22.430 --> 05:23.260
Would you like

05:23.550 --> 05:24.840
to get a divination?

05:41.110 --> 05:42.090
Bro.

05:42.500 --> 05:43.909
Have you recently

05:44.260 --> 05:45.470
suffered bloodshed?

05:48.260 --> 05:49.550
Looks like I'm right.

05:50.230 --> 05:51.080
Just a minor injury.

05:51.180 --> 05:51.740
No big deal.

05:53.230 --> 05:53.990
Bro.

05:54.060 --> 05:55.180
That's not right.

05:55.500 --> 05:56.790
Minor injury matters too.

05:56.870 --> 05:58.260
It may cause serious trouble

05:58.260 --> 06:00.030
if left untreated.

06:00.470 --> 06:01.590
For example,

06:01.590 --> 06:03.300
it may hinder your moves in battles.

06:03.300 --> 06:03.990
That

06:04.260 --> 06:06.310
could be fatal.

06:07.110 --> 06:07.940
But don't worry

06:07.940 --> 06:08.820
too much, bro.

06:09.030 --> 06:10.140
Consider yourself lucky.

06:10.140 --> 06:10.820
You met me today.

06:11.380 --> 06:13.060
I have some medicine here.

06:17.230 --> 06:17.870
This elixir

06:18.230 --> 06:19.430
stops the pain and bleeding.

06:20.700 --> 06:21.510
Take this

06:21.620 --> 06:22.700
to strengthen vitality.

06:29.670 --> 06:31.300
Thank you, my friend.

06:31.820 --> 06:32.470
No problem.

06:33.470 --> 06:34.110
Yingxiang.

06:43.110 --> 06:43.909
Farewell.

06:45.620 --> 06:46.110
Sir.

06:46.350 --> 06:46.870
Coming.

06:47.060 --> 06:47.670
Check please.

06:48.550 --> 06:49.590
Five coins in total.

06:50.620 --> 06:51.350
Okay, thanks.

06:52.180 --> 06:52.870
Young master.

06:53.380 --> 06:55.180
Does he really know divination?

06:56.300 --> 06:57.300
I highly doubt it.

06:58.180 --> 06:59.180
He sniffed it out.

06:59.780 --> 07:00.490
Let's go.

07:07.820 --> 07:08.650
He might be

07:09.470 --> 07:10.940
telling fortunes here.

07:14.670 --> 07:15.940
Isn't it nice here?

07:16.030 --> 07:16.670
Look around.

07:17.060 --> 07:17.640
And

07:17.790 --> 07:18.500
look at them.

07:18.870 --> 07:20.810
They're new girls.

07:20.810 --> 07:21.350
Come on.

07:21.350 --> 07:22.470
Let me show you my room.

07:31.550 --> 07:32.260
Miss.

07:32.500 --> 07:33.620
What's that room for?

07:34.350 --> 07:35.180
That room?

07:35.180 --> 07:36.740
That's where dancers practice.

07:37.060 --> 07:38.470
Then they perform

07:38.470 --> 07:39.620
at noble banquets.

07:40.300 --> 07:41.290
Young master.

07:41.290 --> 07:42.760
The night is too short.

07:43.980 --> 07:44.990
Hurry.

07:46.670 --> 07:47.350
Come on.

07:47.620 --> 07:48.260
Hurry.

07:48.500 --> 07:49.350
Wait here.

07:49.470 --> 07:50.300
I'll fetch wine.

07:51.870 --> 07:52.940
Just a moment.

07:59.550 --> 08:00.470
(Dancers?)

08:00.990 --> 08:01.790
(Perform?)

08:37.990 --> 08:38.539
Hurry.

08:44.140 --> 08:45.470
(Good thing I wore this veil.)

08:45.990 --> 08:47.020
(He doesn't recognize me.)

08:48.870 --> 08:50.420
Why hasn't it started yet?

08:50.660 --> 08:51.990
I've waited forever.

08:52.110 --> 08:52.870
When will it start?

08:52.870 --> 08:54.740
I came just to see Miss Sun.

08:54.830 --> 08:55.540
Start already.

08:55.590 --> 08:56.540
Will you start?

08:57.310 --> 08:58.380
Take care, Mr. Zhang.

08:59.190 --> 09:00.310
What should I do?

09:05.990 --> 09:07.540
Miss Sun isn't feeling well.

09:08.070 --> 09:09.590
She hasn't changed yet.

09:10.500 --> 09:11.710
Go on the stage

09:12.020 --> 09:13.660
and buy us some time.

09:13.660 --> 09:14.980
Hurry.

09:17.660 --> 09:18.830
Nice figure.

09:19.470 --> 09:20.710
Are you going to sing?

09:21.830 --> 09:22.870
What are you waiting for?

09:23.070 --> 09:23.660
Dance.

09:23.660 --> 09:24.380
Just dance.

09:27.900 --> 09:28.710
Just a second.

09:28.710 --> 09:29.230
Dance.

09:29.230 --> 09:30.070
Just a second.

09:31.500 --> 09:32.950
Come on, we're waiting.

09:33.660 --> 09:34.760
Start dancing.

09:35.190 --> 09:36.350
The carriage is ready.

09:37.590 --> 09:38.110
Let's go.

09:40.100 --> 09:40.650
(Never mind.)

09:41.140 --> 09:42.590
(Let me get through this first)

09:43.140 --> 09:44.230
(to avoid being caught.)

09:45.190 --> 09:46.070
(Since Ding Yi)

09:46.470 --> 09:48.380
(is disguised as Sun Xiangfu's servant,)

09:48.990 --> 09:50.260
(I'll see what to do)

09:50.470 --> 09:51.470
(in the Sun Mansion.)

09:54.660 --> 09:55.270
Young master.

09:55.620 --> 09:56.780
May I borrow your sword?

10:14.500 --> 10:15.470
Bravo.

10:17.950 --> 10:18.470
Nice!

10:18.470 --> 10:19.110
Nice!

10:19.660 --> 10:20.310
Nice!

10:20.710 --> 10:21.350
Nice!

10:21.380 --> 10:22.260
Sword dance.

10:22.900 --> 10:24.020
Alright!

10:32.780 --> 10:33.620
Isn't that nice?

10:34.020 --> 10:36.140
Bravo!

10:45.780 --> 10:47.260
Bravo.

11:05.660 --> 11:07.260
A woman disguised as a man.

11:08.990 --> 11:09.660
Interesting.

11:09.870 --> 11:10.500
Nice!

11:14.950 --> 11:16.350
Nice!

11:24.540 --> 11:25.140
(Commander?)

11:25.990 --> 11:26.950
(He actually came in.)

11:31.500 --> 11:32.110
Step down.

11:34.310 --> 11:35.260
Off the stage.

11:57.540 --> 11:58.140
(Oh no.)

11:58.350 --> 11:59.190
(I lost the rhythm.)

12:39.540 --> 12:41.140
Bravo!

12:41.470 --> 12:42.070
Bravo!

13:01.070 --> 13:02.140
Nice!

13:37.540 --> 13:40.140
Nice!

13:40.470 --> 13:41.590
Nice!

13:49.110 --> 13:50.590
Thank you for the flower.

13:52.020 --> 13:52.780
A flower

13:53.380 --> 13:54.540
for a beauty.

14:01.190 --> 14:02.020
(It's him.)

14:28.740 --> 14:32.020
Bravo.

14:44.710 --> 14:45.540
(This woman)

14:46.310 --> 14:47.740
(has sheer audacity.)

14:50.070 --> 14:50.710
How was that?

14:51.710 --> 14:52.420
Wasn't it great?

14:52.500 --> 14:53.260
(That was close.)

14:53.990 --> 14:54.620
(I knew)

14:55.380 --> 14:56.420
(Xiao Jue wouldn't)

14:56.830 --> 14:58.350
(recognize me in this attire.)

14:59.140 --> 14:59.590
Mr. Chu.

15:00.230 --> 15:01.020
Long time no see.

15:01.710 --> 15:02.710
Masterful flute work.

15:04.500 --> 15:05.740
Thank you for your praise.

15:06.950 --> 15:07.820
But

15:08.350 --> 15:10.020
I didn't expect to see you here.

15:10.990 --> 15:11.740
What a small world.

15:13.500 --> 15:14.020
This way.

15:18.500 --> 15:19.620
What are you doing?

15:20.350 --> 15:20.900
Let me go.

15:20.900 --> 15:22.110
Hurry. Bring her back.

15:22.620 --> 15:23.110
Hurry.

15:23.350 --> 15:24.260
Bring her back.

15:24.500 --> 15:25.020
Let me go.

15:25.420 --> 15:26.660
Catch her! Hurry.

15:26.870 --> 15:27.470
Bring her back.

15:27.740 --> 15:28.900
Don't let her get away.

15:29.190 --> 15:29.950
Grab her.

15:30.310 --> 15:30.830
Hurry.

15:31.190 --> 15:32.140
Get her back.

15:32.190 --> 15:33.110
Don't let her get away.

15:33.310 --> 15:34.190
Tie her up.

15:34.900 --> 15:35.540
Tie her up.

15:35.540 --> 15:36.500
Somebody help.

15:37.990 --> 15:38.990
Young Master Sun's men

15:38.990 --> 15:39.900
will be here shortly.

15:40.310 --> 15:41.110
Do her makeup.

15:41.350 --> 15:41.870
Hurry up.

15:48.350 --> 15:49.470
Drink some more.

15:49.990 --> 15:51.230
It's been a year

15:51.990 --> 15:53.070
since we parted in Yaojing.

15:54.190 --> 15:55.420
Now we met in Yezhou.

15:56.350 --> 15:58.140
The court knows
that Yezhou Garrison faces

15:58.140 --> 15:59.020
supply shortages.

15:59.260 --> 15:59.830
I came

16:00.110 --> 16:01.830
by decree to resolve this matter.

16:02.500 --> 16:04.110
So the inspector they sent

16:04.660 --> 16:05.350
is you.

16:05.710 --> 16:06.950
Thank you for your hard work.

16:08.020 --> 16:08.950
We should thank you

16:08.990 --> 16:09.710
for training

16:10.070 --> 16:11.230
the recruits in Yezhou.

16:11.830 --> 16:12.590
I'm just holding

16:12.830 --> 16:13.950
a nominal position.

16:14.830 --> 16:15.590
Besides,

16:15.830 --> 16:17.140
I don't know anyone in Yezhou

16:17.540 --> 16:18.830
to do my job as the inspector.

16:19.380 --> 16:20.310
I hardly deserve

16:20.780 --> 16:21.710
any praise.

16:32.990 --> 16:33.540
Oh, right.

16:34.380 --> 16:36.420
Have you met Magistrate Sun yet?

16:37.590 --> 16:38.660
My nephew insisted

16:39.260 --> 16:40.470
on touring Yezhou.

16:41.020 --> 16:42.620
So I came a few days earlier.

16:43.540 --> 16:44.500
Could you please

16:44.830 --> 16:45.540
keep it a secret?

16:45.990 --> 16:46.760
What a coincidence.

16:47.110 --> 16:47.710
I also came

16:47.740 --> 16:48.830
a few days earlier

16:49.190 --> 16:51.230
to learn a few things about Yezhou.

16:54.180 --> 16:54.870
No business talks

16:55.310 --> 16:56.350
since we're here for fun.

16:56.980 --> 16:58.420
I've long heard of the snowscapes

16:58.660 --> 17:00.140
of Yezhou Garrison.

17:00.980 --> 17:02.420
Extend your stay and you'll surely

17:03.030 --> 17:04.109
get to see it.

17:07.069 --> 17:07.940
Do visit again.

17:08.380 --> 17:09.140
Upstairs, please.

17:10.750 --> 17:12.069
Leaving so soon, Mr. Wang.

17:27.790 --> 17:28.349
Young master,

17:28.830 --> 17:29.660
don't you like

17:29.700 --> 17:30.510
any of the girls?

17:31.030 --> 17:31.940
You're leaving so soon.

17:32.550 --> 17:33.350
Young master.

17:35.700 --> 17:36.830
(He Yan crosses paths)

17:36.870 --> 17:37.830
(with Chu Zhao.)

17:38.380 --> 17:39.900
(And he's so focused on He Yan.)

17:40.590 --> 17:41.220
(Could it be)

17:41.700 --> 17:42.900
(that they know each other?)

17:44.590 --> 17:45.350
It's getting late.

17:45.940 --> 17:46.790
I have to go.

17:47.590 --> 17:48.180
Presumably,

17:48.590 --> 17:49.380
our next meeting

17:49.900 --> 17:51.110
will be at the Sun Mansion.

17:56.830 --> 17:57.590
Take care.

18:58.500 --> 18:59.070
Let's go.

19:17.030 --> 19:18.140
Sorry, I'm starving.

19:18.620 --> 19:19.900
This isn't my usual manner.

19:21.420 --> 19:22.540
It's fine. Just eat.

19:22.830 --> 19:23.510
Talk over food.

19:25.110 --> 19:26.120
Where were we?

19:27.110 --> 19:27.850
Wedding escape.

19:28.620 --> 19:29.620
Yeah, wedding escape.

19:30.140 --> 19:31.110
My name is Song Taotao.

19:31.220 --> 19:32.140
I ran away from home.

19:32.460 --> 19:33.940
I was passing through Yezhou

19:34.180 --> 19:35.380
when I got abducted.

19:36.180 --> 19:37.550
Thankfully, you saved me.

19:38.590 --> 19:39.980
(Song Taotao?)

19:41.900 --> 19:42.940
He Yan is studying

19:43.220 --> 19:44.980
at Xianchang Academy now.

19:45.940 --> 19:47.700
Nobody has discovered the truth.

19:47.980 --> 19:48.750
Good to know.

19:49.700 --> 19:51.310
He Yan is 15 now.

19:52.460 --> 19:54.270
We must arrange for his marriage

19:54.900 --> 19:56.750
before he reaches 18.

19:57.310 --> 19:58.340
(Marriage?)

19:59.030 --> 20:00.350
(I'm not a man.)

20:00.660 --> 20:01.590
(How do I get married?)

20:02.380 --> 20:03.220
(Once I'm engaged,)

20:03.660 --> 20:05.070
(who will be "He Rufei"?)

20:05.660 --> 20:07.550
The daughter
of the Chief Imperial Physician,

20:07.550 --> 20:08.380
Song Taotao.

20:09.030 --> 20:10.900
She seems like a perfect match

20:10.980 --> 20:12.030
for He Yan.

20:12.380 --> 20:14.220
We can form a marital alliance.

20:16.070 --> 20:16.660
(I will never)

20:16.660 --> 20:17.980
(get engaged to Miss Song.)

20:18.510 --> 20:19.270
(Not only that,)

20:19.830 --> 20:20.550
(I will never)

20:20.550 --> 20:21.550
(marry any woman,)

20:21.940 --> 20:23.350
(so as not to ruin her life.)

20:28.550 --> 20:29.980
(Isn't she the one who almost)

20:29.980 --> 20:31.460
(became my fiancée?)

20:32.310 --> 20:33.510
(Fate truly connects us.)

20:39.940 --> 20:42.420
Why are you looking at me like that?

20:43.420 --> 20:44.220
It's nothing.

20:44.550 --> 20:46.510
So, who abducted you?

20:48.460 --> 20:49.220
I don't know.

20:49.620 --> 20:51.270
I ran into him the moment I arrived.

20:52.140 --> 20:53.870
His lackeys called him

20:54.420 --> 20:55.400
Young Master Sun.

20:55.790 --> 20:56.790
He called me pretty,

20:57.140 --> 20:58.380
asked me to be his mistress,

20:58.460 --> 20:59.420
and tried to assault me.

20:59.830 --> 21:00.900
So I stabbed his arm

21:01.140 --> 21:02.350
with my hairpin.

21:05.030 --> 21:05.980
You may look frail,

21:06.140 --> 21:07.660
but you have a fiery temper.

21:08.270 --> 21:09.140
But I didn't expect

21:09.220 --> 21:10.030
that I couldn't

21:10.180 --> 21:10.870
get rid of them.

21:11.310 --> 21:12.270
I could have run away

21:12.380 --> 21:13.590
if I had been careful.

21:14.510 --> 21:15.700
It sounds like you know

21:15.870 --> 21:17.380
how to defend yourself.

21:21.380 --> 21:22.460
What are those?

21:23.660 --> 21:25.130
This is datura

21:25.420 --> 21:27.030
for sedation and anesthesia.

21:29.870 --> 21:31.080
This is arisaema

21:31.180 --> 21:32.900
for calming convulsions.

21:36.790 --> 21:38.310
This withered flower

21:38.310 --> 21:39.270
is rhododendron molle

21:39.460 --> 21:40.980
for blood circulation and pain relief.

21:43.660 --> 21:44.870
These sliced pieces

21:44.900 --> 21:45.590
are aconite.

21:45.870 --> 21:47.750
- They dispel cold and relieve pain.
- Wait.

21:48.700 --> 21:49.580
All these herbs

21:49.790 --> 21:51.110
are poisonous, right?

21:51.660 --> 21:52.220
Yeah.

21:52.550 --> 21:53.180
Maybe

21:53.310 --> 21:54.590
they'll come in handy later.

21:56.140 --> 21:57.460
Not really. Put them away.

22:04.070 --> 22:04.750
Anyway,

22:04.870 --> 22:05.980
this "Young Master Sun"

22:07.180 --> 22:08.980
could be the son of Yezhou Magistrate

22:09.270 --> 22:10.420
Sun Xiangfu.

22:11.180 --> 22:12.700
That complicates things.

22:18.220 --> 22:18.980
Sir,

22:19.220 --> 22:20.110
I'm Song Taotao.

22:20.510 --> 22:21.350
I'll repay

22:21.510 --> 22:22.270
your kindness

22:22.270 --> 22:23.370
when I return to Yaojing.

22:23.590 --> 22:24.310
Hero,

22:24.460 --> 22:25.420
what's your name?

22:26.590 --> 22:27.140
I'm flattered.

22:27.510 --> 22:28.270
My name...

22:30.900 --> 22:31.900
My name is Cheng...

22:40.180 --> 22:40.750
Hurry.

22:45.700 --> 22:47.220
They just won't leave us alone.

22:54.550 --> 22:55.530
I underestimated them.

22:55.750 --> 22:56.750
You're from the capital

22:56.750 --> 22:57.830
and don't sound local.

22:58.070 --> 22:58.940
They must have guessed

22:59.070 --> 23:00.180
we'd come to an inn.

23:01.350 --> 23:01.900
Forget it.

23:02.460 --> 23:03.830
We're on their turf, after all.

23:04.110 --> 23:04.590
Stay here.

23:04.750 --> 23:05.510
I'll handle it.

23:07.270 --> 23:08.220
In that case,

23:08.510 --> 23:10.030
it's kind of my turf, too.

23:10.750 --> 23:11.590
I'm quite capable.

23:13.590 --> 23:14.900
You're not local, either.

23:15.220 --> 23:16.110
Helping me may get you

23:16.140 --> 23:17.350
into serious trouble.

23:17.510 --> 23:18.790
Others didn't dare help me.

23:19.110 --> 23:20.310
Why are you helping me?

23:24.140 --> 23:24.750
Because

23:25.420 --> 23:26.350
you're a woman.

23:28.620 --> 23:29.940
(And so am I.)

23:38.270 --> 23:39.070
Hurry up.

23:39.350 --> 23:39.940
Move.

23:40.310 --> 23:40.870
Hurry up.

23:41.220 --> 23:41.750
Go.

23:42.070 --> 23:42.700
And you.

23:43.110 --> 23:43.700
Move.

23:43.700 --> 23:44.270
Hurry.

23:44.270 --> 23:44.830
Out.

23:46.660 --> 23:47.180
Move.

23:47.380 --> 23:47.980
Go.

23:48.180 --> 23:48.790
(Sun Ling, son of Sun Xiangfu)
Out.

23:48.980 --> 23:49.590
Stop dawdling.

23:49.830 --> 23:50.350
Faster.

23:50.380 --> 23:51.180
Get going.

23:51.350 --> 23:51.910
Go.

23:52.620 --> 23:53.140
Hurry up.

23:54.350 --> 23:55.180
Why is that door

23:55.310 --> 23:56.110
closed?

23:57.110 --> 23:57.900
Let's check it.

23:59.220 --> 23:59.900
Let's go.

24:00.070 --> 24:00.660
Let's go.

24:06.460 --> 24:07.050
Open the door.

24:07.310 --> 24:07.830
Open up.

24:08.310 --> 24:09.220
Coming.

24:09.750 --> 24:11.030
Hurry up.

24:12.380 --> 24:13.900
It's so late. What's going on?

24:14.620 --> 24:15.660
Step aside.

24:18.830 --> 24:20.180
Search thoroughly.

24:22.420 --> 24:23.140
Young master.

24:23.220 --> 24:23.940
Put this on.

24:24.140 --> 24:24.790
It's chilly.

24:25.830 --> 24:26.790
Search carefully.

24:38.830 --> 24:39.460
Mr. Sun.

24:39.750 --> 24:40.350
She's not here.

24:43.070 --> 24:43.590
It's so late.

24:43.700 --> 24:44.590
Who said you could

24:44.590 --> 24:45.770
just barge into my room?

24:46.700 --> 24:47.660
This is ridiculous.

24:48.180 --> 24:49.350
Do I need permission

24:49.350 --> 24:50.090
to go anywhere

24:50.090 --> 24:51.310
in Yezhou?

24:53.140 --> 24:54.550
Keep your eyes sharp.

24:55.700 --> 24:56.870
Inspect them.

24:57.510 --> 24:58.220
Understood.

25:10.660 --> 25:11.370
Looking similar.

25:14.140 --> 25:15.510
What's your name?

25:16.270 --> 25:17.420
Cheng Lisu.

25:22.510 --> 25:23.550
Raise your head.

25:27.620 --> 25:28.420
Hey, you.

25:28.660 --> 25:29.750
Raise your head.

25:29.830 --> 25:30.590
Sir.

25:30.870 --> 25:32.140
Don't cross the line.

25:35.220 --> 25:35.980
So it turns out

25:36.310 --> 25:37.590
that the assassin who abducted

25:37.590 --> 25:38.460
my concubine

25:39.070 --> 25:40.110
is you.

25:41.350 --> 25:42.220
Guards.

25:42.660 --> 25:43.830
Arrest

25:44.350 --> 25:45.220
both of them.

25:45.420 --> 25:46.030
Understood.

25:48.550 --> 25:49.220
It's fine.

25:50.460 --> 25:51.050
Move.

25:59.270 --> 26:00.040
Mr. Sun.

26:00.660 --> 26:01.350
I suggest you

26:01.900 --> 26:04.110
think twice before arresting me.

26:04.220 --> 26:05.000
Do you know

26:05.110 --> 26:05.900
who my uncle is?

26:06.590 --> 26:07.420
- Who's your uncle?
- Who's your uncle?

26:09.350 --> 26:10.310
My uncle

26:10.510 --> 26:12.700
is appointed by His Majesty

26:12.700 --> 26:13.750
as General Fengyun

26:14.790 --> 26:15.820
and Right Army Commander.

26:15.940 --> 26:16.750
Xiao Jue.

26:17.790 --> 26:18.420
How about that?

26:18.550 --> 26:19.550
Still arresting me?

26:25.550 --> 26:26.790
Did you hear that?

26:27.460 --> 26:28.660
Who's his uncle again?

26:32.590 --> 26:33.110
You brat.

26:34.030 --> 26:35.310
If Xiao Jue is your uncle,

26:35.340 --> 26:36.460
get him here.

26:36.940 --> 26:37.980
He's your uncle. So what?

26:38.140 --> 26:38.830
So ridiculous.

26:39.110 --> 26:40.790
Today I'll make you beg

26:40.980 --> 26:42.220
for death

26:42.700 --> 26:44.110
in front of him.

26:47.270 --> 26:47.790
Really?

26:52.460 --> 26:53.380
Try your luck.

26:58.380 --> 26:58.900
See?

26:59.110 --> 27:00.180
That's my uncle.

27:01.070 --> 27:01.700
Let go.

27:02.900 --> 27:03.820
Huaijin.

27:05.180 --> 27:06.140
Come on, who are you?

27:07.620 --> 27:08.420
Didn't you hear?

27:15.700 --> 27:16.780
Has General Fengyun

27:17.270 --> 27:17.900
arrived?

27:17.980 --> 27:18.790
We haven't heard.

27:23.460 --> 27:24.660
How dare you fool

27:24.900 --> 27:26.420
falsely claim official titles?

27:26.700 --> 27:27.340
You

27:27.420 --> 27:28.790
abducted my family member.

27:29.510 --> 27:31.140
You're courting death.

27:45.310 --> 27:46.660
Ouch.

27:47.660 --> 27:48.350
It hurts.

27:51.590 --> 27:52.180
Ling.

27:52.660 --> 27:53.220
Ling.

27:53.940 --> 27:54.550
Father.

27:54.870 --> 27:55.750
Who did this to you?

27:56.030 --> 27:57.060
(Sun Xiangfu, Yezhou Magistrate)
Guards. He...

27:57.660 --> 27:58.180
Young master.

28:00.310 --> 28:00.940
Commander?

28:01.700 --> 28:02.310
Commander.

28:02.550 --> 28:03.870
I failed to welcome you

28:03.980 --> 28:04.550
properly.

28:04.620 --> 28:05.980
I beg for your forgiveness.

28:09.350 --> 28:10.980
Why is Magistrate Sun

28:11.030 --> 28:12.110
begging for forgiveness?

28:13.790 --> 28:15.350
Your son was quite domineering

28:15.350 --> 28:16.590
upstairs earlier.

28:17.180 --> 28:18.830
First, he tried to abduct my servant,

28:19.220 --> 28:20.750
then he threatened to kill me.

28:21.270 --> 28:22.070
He even said

28:22.270 --> 28:23.550
he'd make me beg for death

28:23.700 --> 28:24.700
in front of my uncle.

28:24.940 --> 28:25.510
W-What...

28:25.660 --> 28:26.980
You're begging for forgiveness?

28:27.790 --> 28:28.350
Seriously.

28:28.590 --> 28:29.590
We're terrified.

28:30.070 --> 28:31.050
Right?

28:31.140 --> 28:32.140
Uncle?

28:33.380 --> 28:35.220
Commander,
I failed to discipline my son.

28:35.310 --> 28:36.460
He didn't know who you were

28:36.460 --> 28:37.270
and offended you

28:37.270 --> 28:37.900
and...

28:38.750 --> 28:39.310
Cheng.

28:39.790 --> 28:40.620
Mr. Cheng.

28:41.180 --> 28:42.420
I sincerely...

28:42.590 --> 28:43.380
I-I...

28:43.870 --> 28:44.550
Come here.

28:44.980 --> 28:45.620
Come here.

28:46.700 --> 28:47.350
Get over here.

28:48.510 --> 28:49.110
Lower.

28:50.550 --> 28:51.180
Lower.

28:52.110 --> 28:52.550
Father.

28:52.700 --> 28:53.510
He hit me.

28:54.700 --> 28:55.310
He hit you?

28:56.590 --> 28:57.620
You should avenge me.

28:57.620 --> 28:58.140
Avenge you?

28:58.460 --> 28:59.510
I'll beat you to death.

28:59.790 --> 29:00.980
You're asking for this.

29:01.220 --> 29:02.350
You're asking for this.

29:02.590 --> 29:03.700
Why are you hitting me?

29:03.830 --> 29:05.380
You're asking for this.

29:05.620 --> 29:06.220
You want me

29:06.550 --> 29:07.870
to avenge you?

29:08.420 --> 29:09.310
I don't even know

29:09.310 --> 29:10.220
if I'll survive this.

29:10.220 --> 29:10.900
Avenge you?

29:11.310 --> 29:12.030
How about this?

29:12.590 --> 29:13.140
I will

29:13.220 --> 29:14.510
break my son's legs

29:14.550 --> 29:15.220
as an apology.

29:15.420 --> 29:16.310
What do you think?

29:23.380 --> 29:24.870
My mother has aged.

29:24.980 --> 29:25.620
And this is

29:25.700 --> 29:26.510
my only son.

29:26.750 --> 29:27.660
If he dies,

29:27.940 --> 29:29.550
our family line ends with me.

29:30.110 --> 29:30.590
Please

29:30.940 --> 29:31.830
punish me instead

29:32.180 --> 29:33.510
and spare my son.

29:33.830 --> 29:34.220
Please.

29:35.940 --> 29:36.700
Mr. Sun.

29:37.790 --> 29:39.380
Your son doesn't have to recognize me.

29:39.980 --> 29:41.830
But the inspector is on his way here.

29:42.140 --> 29:42.900
If your son

29:42.980 --> 29:44.140
mistakes the inspector

29:44.310 --> 29:45.460
for an impostor,

29:45.980 --> 29:46.750
then he may

29:47.140 --> 29:48.550
have to die for it.

29:48.790 --> 29:49.460
It won't happen.

29:49.700 --> 29:50.380
It won't happen.

29:50.590 --> 29:51.510
I assure you.

30:10.790 --> 30:12.220
Thank you, Commander.

30:15.750 --> 30:16.460
Get up.

30:16.620 --> 30:17.140
Let's go.

30:17.590 --> 30:18.140
Let's go.

30:21.590 --> 30:22.280
Come back.

30:22.510 --> 30:23.460
Where are you going?

30:23.460 --> 30:24.520
This way.

30:24.660 --> 30:25.420
Let's go.

30:25.550 --> 30:26.180
Faster.

30:26.420 --> 30:27.180
Get moving.

30:27.830 --> 30:28.980
Hurry.

30:29.270 --> 30:30.420
Hurry.

30:30.750 --> 30:31.300
We're off.

30:51.510 --> 30:53.550
Sun Ling was abusing his power.

30:53.660 --> 30:54.550
What a disgrace.

30:55.220 --> 30:56.110
If I hadn't...

31:01.510 --> 31:02.110
Anyway,

31:02.380 --> 31:04.310
I ran into Miss Song on the street

31:04.350 --> 31:05.260
and brought her here.

31:10.590 --> 31:12.170
I did this to promote

31:12.170 --> 31:12.900
your reputation

31:12.900 --> 31:15.140
as a people's hero, Commander.

31:15.830 --> 31:16.660
I don't need that.

31:21.750 --> 31:22.460
I think

31:22.790 --> 31:24.350
we should take Miss Song

31:24.350 --> 31:24.900
with us.

31:25.350 --> 31:26.380
If she stays in Yezhou,

31:26.380 --> 31:28.030
Sun Ling will surely retaliate.

31:28.510 --> 31:29.220
You rescued her.

31:29.870 --> 31:30.750
You'll handle it.

31:35.660 --> 31:36.550
Mr. Xiao.

31:37.110 --> 31:38.280
I'm Song Taotao.

31:40.350 --> 31:41.070
Miss Song.

31:41.590 --> 31:42.510
You know each other?

31:43.550 --> 31:44.220
I'm engaged

31:44.380 --> 31:45.750
to Mr. Xiao...

31:46.380 --> 31:47.110
What?

31:48.900 --> 31:49.640
Mr. Xiao's nephew.

31:51.460 --> 31:52.220
Miss Song,

31:52.790 --> 31:54.350
don't leave sentences half-finished.

32:00.180 --> 32:00.790
Wait.

32:03.830 --> 32:04.460
Commander.

32:06.310 --> 32:07.530
How many nephews do you have?

32:11.140 --> 32:11.940
Wedding escape.

32:13.030 --> 32:13.790
Engagement.

32:17.550 --> 32:18.070
Y-You're...

32:18.220 --> 32:19.550
You're Cheng Lisu's...

32:19.550 --> 32:21.270
I'm Cheng Lisu's so-called

32:21.660 --> 32:22.380
fiancée.

32:26.550 --> 32:27.700
(I joined the army)

32:27.940 --> 32:28.940
(to escape marriage.)

32:29.590 --> 32:30.700
(Then Song Taotao)

32:30.900 --> 32:32.350
(got engaged to Cheng Lisu.)

32:32.830 --> 32:34.790
(Both of them fled.)

32:35.350 --> 32:36.750
(How strange is fate.)

32:37.140 --> 32:38.310
(It's a cycle.)

32:38.700 --> 32:39.380
Mr. Xiao,

32:39.870 --> 32:40.590
can you take me

32:40.590 --> 32:41.420
to Yezhou Garrison?

32:41.940 --> 32:43.310
I won't cause any trouble.

32:43.620 --> 32:44.750
Are you sure about that?

32:45.270 --> 32:46.140
Your fiancé

32:46.590 --> 32:47.460
is right there.

32:47.790 --> 32:48.870
I'm looking for him.

32:53.110 --> 32:53.700
You've been

32:53.790 --> 32:55.070
impersonating Cheng Lisu, right?

32:55.550 --> 32:57.380
The real Cheng Lisu
couldn't fight at all.

32:57.790 --> 32:58.510
I bet it's hard

32:58.790 --> 32:59.870
to impersonate him.

33:01.830 --> 33:02.460
In that case,

33:02.980 --> 33:04.070
stay with us for now.

33:05.420 --> 33:06.550
You saved Miss Song.

33:07.310 --> 33:08.030
You'll handle it.

33:08.620 --> 33:09.380
Me?

33:10.380 --> 33:12.350
She's your nephew's fiancée.

33:12.750 --> 33:13.620
That's not true.

33:15.660 --> 33:16.420
You heard her.

33:24.350 --> 33:25.980
I lost my luggage and money

33:26.140 --> 33:26.980
because of

33:27.030 --> 33:27.870
those hooligans.

33:28.900 --> 33:29.460
Could you

33:29.790 --> 33:31.270
front my room payment?

33:31.830 --> 33:32.940
I'll repay double...

33:33.350 --> 33:33.940
No.

33:34.310 --> 33:35.510
Tenfold.

33:39.140 --> 33:41.360
(Sun Mansion)

33:47.140 --> 33:49.590
Why did you have to provoke

33:51.180 --> 33:53.110
the living God of Death?

33:56.310 --> 33:56.870
Come on.

33:57.500 --> 33:59.340
He's just a military officer.

33:59.830 --> 34:01.150
Father, why are you so timid?

34:02.380 --> 34:03.750
"Just a military officer"?

34:05.020 --> 34:06.380
When he followed

34:06.580 --> 34:07.580
Xiao Zhongwu west,

34:07.750 --> 34:09.150
he dared to behead the eldest son

34:09.310 --> 34:10.460
of the censor.

34:11.630 --> 34:12.350
Minister Xu

34:12.420 --> 34:13.310
brought this case

34:13.310 --> 34:14.270
to His Majesty.

34:14.500 --> 34:15.500
And what happened?

34:15.900 --> 34:17.540
Minister Xu had to swallow his losses.

34:18.350 --> 34:19.540
If he actually kills you,

34:19.670 --> 34:20.940
what do you think

34:21.380 --> 34:22.310
I could do?

34:24.380 --> 34:26.630
Absolutely nothing.

34:29.150 --> 34:30.020
He...

34:30.190 --> 34:31.230
He's that powerful?

34:32.630 --> 34:33.150
Then,

34:33.420 --> 34:34.500
what should we do?

34:34.790 --> 34:36.540
Take it easy.

34:38.540 --> 34:40.310
I've had a trap ready for a long time,

34:42.190 --> 34:44.830
waiting to spring it.

34:49.020 --> 34:49.980
Don't worry, son.

34:50.460 --> 34:52.060
I'll make sure

34:52.310 --> 34:54.350
you're avenged.

34:56.710 --> 34:57.290
Father,

34:57.420 --> 34:58.540
I know you're the best.

34:58.940 --> 34:59.940
But for now,

35:00.500 --> 35:02.830
keep your head down.

35:05.900 --> 35:06.980
Get rid of

35:07.150 --> 35:08.670
the stuff

35:08.980 --> 35:09.870
you buried.

35:15.350 --> 35:15.980
This box.

35:16.380 --> 35:17.160
I'll take some too.

35:18.100 --> 35:19.020
Cheng Lisu and I

35:19.020 --> 35:20.020
never got along.

35:20.460 --> 35:21.900
But my father,

35:22.090 --> 35:23.500
who's Cheng Lusu's master,

35:23.900 --> 35:25.320
suddenly got a wild idea

35:25.460 --> 35:26.500
of getting us married.

35:26.940 --> 35:28.380
His family actually approved.

35:29.150 --> 35:30.750
I was planning to run away.

35:31.100 --> 35:31.750
But he actually

35:31.900 --> 35:32.870
beat me to it.

35:33.310 --> 35:34.100
It's a total

35:34.100 --> 35:34.900
humiliation.

35:35.350 --> 35:35.980
So, I came here

35:36.190 --> 35:36.900
to get him home

35:37.100 --> 35:38.540
and cancel the engagement.

35:38.980 --> 35:40.270
You don't like Mr. Cheng?

35:41.100 --> 35:42.420
I think he's quite admirable.

35:42.790 --> 35:43.710
Good-looking,

35:43.870 --> 35:44.830
well-born,

35:44.900 --> 35:45.940
and a brilliant doctor.

35:45.940 --> 35:46.940
I bet he has

35:46.980 --> 35:48.020
many admirers

35:48.190 --> 35:48.940
in Yaojing.

35:49.420 --> 35:50.190
In medicine,

35:50.310 --> 35:50.980
the heart guides,

35:51.310 --> 35:52.140
the hands follow.

35:52.540 --> 35:53.350
But look at him.

35:53.750 --> 35:55.270
Instead of helping people,

35:55.630 --> 35:56.460
he's buttering up

35:56.540 --> 35:58.060
the imperial consorts and princesses.

35:58.230 --> 35:59.150
So spineless.

35:59.380 --> 36:00.420
I despise him.

36:02.150 --> 36:03.060
You're much better.

36:06.710 --> 36:07.380
Well...

36:08.150 --> 36:09.380
It's not a fair comparison.

36:12.270 --> 36:13.100
Candies.

36:14.460 --> 36:15.540
Is this osmanthus-flavored?

36:15.540 --> 36:15.980
Yeah.

36:16.060 --> 36:17.100
That's right.

36:19.710 --> 36:20.740
Even blind,

36:20.940 --> 36:22.150
aim to be

36:22.710 --> 36:23.670
the most special of all.

36:25.020 --> 36:26.060
This osmanthus candy

36:26.750 --> 36:28.870
is the last piece left in the world.

36:29.790 --> 36:30.900
Though inedible now,

36:31.830 --> 36:32.670
it remains sweet.

36:32.870 --> 36:33.740
I won't know

36:33.900 --> 36:34.980
until I taste it.

36:37.060 --> 36:37.800
Though

36:38.100 --> 36:39.270
bitter at first taste,

36:39.750 --> 36:40.540
its core holds

36:40.790 --> 36:41.900
enduring sweetness.

36:43.830 --> 36:44.750
Have it.

36:48.980 --> 36:49.830
I once had

36:49.870 --> 36:50.710
an osmanthus candy.

36:51.500 --> 36:52.270
Not so sweet.

36:52.900 --> 36:53.830
Even a bit bitter.

36:54.710 --> 36:55.630
But it was the best

36:55.670 --> 36:56.940
osmanthus candy in the world.

37:00.230 --> 37:00.940
Someone also

37:00.980 --> 37:01.980
loves osmanthus candies.

37:02.580 --> 37:03.580
One packet please.

37:03.940 --> 37:04.580
Alright.

37:06.350 --> 37:07.150
Is it

37:07.500 --> 37:08.420
for me?

37:10.150 --> 37:10.940
Want some?

37:11.460 --> 37:12.460
Buy your own.

37:12.710 --> 37:13.540
This is a gift.

37:14.350 --> 37:14.900
There you go.

37:15.100 --> 37:15.660
It's ready.

37:15.830 --> 37:16.540
Keep the change.

37:16.540 --> 37:17.380
Thank you.

37:17.940 --> 37:18.500
Let's go.

37:21.630 --> 37:22.820
Another girl's gone missing.

37:22.820 --> 37:23.790
It keeps happening

37:23.790 --> 37:24.500
over these years.

37:24.900 --> 37:26.230
They're nowhere to be found.

37:26.540 --> 37:27.230
It's tragic.

37:27.790 --> 37:28.630
They say that

37:28.940 --> 37:29.630
Young Master Sun

37:29.710 --> 37:31.540
abducts pretty girls every now and then.

37:31.940 --> 37:32.790
Nobody reported it?

37:32.980 --> 37:33.460
His father

37:33.630 --> 37:34.460
is the Magistrate.

37:34.790 --> 37:35.380
Actually,

37:35.580 --> 37:36.870
once an eyewitness

37:37.020 --> 37:38.580
and the victim's family reported it.

37:38.870 --> 37:40.150
But both of them

37:40.310 --> 37:41.710
were beaten half to death

37:41.900 --> 37:42.750
and thrown out.

37:43.190 --> 37:43.940
After that,

37:44.020 --> 37:45.230
nobody dared step forward.

37:47.460 --> 37:48.380
The other girls

37:48.630 --> 37:49.630
weren't as lucky as you.

37:53.310 --> 37:53.830
Don't worry.

37:54.790 --> 37:55.460
I'll protect you.

37:57.830 --> 37:58.420
I know

37:58.790 --> 38:00.150
you'll always look out for me.

38:01.460 --> 38:02.150
Let's go.

38:05.020 --> 38:06.100
Can't anyone do something

38:06.100 --> 38:07.110
about Young Master Sun?

38:10.900 --> 38:11.460
Commander.

38:12.630 --> 38:14.310
I was thinking about you while shopping

38:14.380 --> 38:15.380
with Miss Song.

38:15.750 --> 38:17.270
I bought you osmanthus candies.

38:19.940 --> 38:20.520
Try some.

38:20.980 --> 38:21.640
Take them away.

38:22.830 --> 38:23.350
Why?

38:23.500 --> 38:24.780
They're really sweet.

38:25.060 --> 38:25.900
I don't eat sweets.

38:26.310 --> 38:27.350
But you clearly...

38:31.100 --> 38:31.750
I clearly what?

38:33.190 --> 38:34.790
Putting loaches in my shoes.

38:39.020 --> 38:40.230
These candies got dirty.

38:41.710 --> 38:42.540
Don't eat those.

38:42.750 --> 38:44.310
Should I buy you new ones?

38:44.310 --> 38:45.310
No need. Go to class.

38:53.060 --> 38:53.940
You're just

38:55.060 --> 38:56.670
looking down on my cheap gifts.

38:57.630 --> 38:58.190
Fine,

38:58.350 --> 38:59.420
keep them for Mr. Feinu.

38:59.580 --> 39:00.650
He won't eat them, either.

39:01.130 --> 39:01.960
You...

39:04.150 --> 39:04.670
Commander.

39:07.060 --> 39:08.420
The inspector made his appearance.

39:09.060 --> 39:10.100
So, Sun Xiangfu

39:10.940 --> 39:12.500
will invite us to his mansion today.

39:13.830 --> 39:14.830
Get ready.

39:15.460 --> 39:16.460
We're going today?

39:17.100 --> 39:17.980
He's invited us.

39:19.060 --> 39:20.670
The inspector

39:21.710 --> 39:22.940
will likely be there too.

39:28.190 --> 39:28.710
Commander.

39:29.100 --> 39:30.150
Are you worried about me?

39:32.060 --> 39:32.980
Stop talking

39:33.150 --> 39:33.750
and think about

39:33.940 --> 39:35.580
how to maintain your cover.

39:36.230 --> 39:37.190
Cheng Lisu is

39:37.230 --> 39:38.410
a renowned noble in Yaojing.

39:38.540 --> 39:39.190
And you...

39:39.540 --> 39:40.630
In Yaojing,

39:41.190 --> 39:42.060
someone like me

39:42.630 --> 39:43.540
could at least

39:43.870 --> 39:45.420
rival Mr. Cheng, if not stand equal

39:45.460 --> 39:46.350
to you.

39:46.750 --> 39:47.420
Otherwise,

39:47.630 --> 39:48.790
why did Miss Song

39:49.270 --> 39:51.020
only remind me to be careful,

39:51.150 --> 39:52.150
and not you?

39:57.260 --> 39:58.010
(Sun Mansion)

39:58.020 --> 39:59.750
What an honor to have you here.

39:59.750 --> 40:01.310
My warmest welcome.

40:01.310 --> 40:02.830
My warmest welcome.

40:07.100 --> 40:08.460
This is the inspector,

40:08.460 --> 40:10.190
Mr. Chu Zhao.

40:12.830 --> 40:13.460
Commander Xiao.

40:13.670 --> 40:14.420
Long time no see.

40:14.750 --> 40:15.460
Mr. Chu.

40:16.060 --> 40:16.830
Long time no see.

40:24.500 --> 40:25.350
(It's him?)

40:26.060 --> 40:27.830
(He's the inspector?)

